        {
          "title": "面包板手表",
          "content": "<p>面包板是电路实验的基本工具。一位国外爱好者制作了一块面包板手表，可以戴在手上。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202305/bg2023052801.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>他在面包板上，集成了电池、电路、定时器和 LED 显示屏。他还把自己写的固件，放到了 <a href=\"https://github.com/ingepnet/breadboardwatch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202305/bg2023052802.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "面包板手表",
              "url": "https://ingep.net/breadboardwatch/"
            },
            {
              "text": "GitHub",
              "url": "https://github.com/ingepnet/breadboardwatch"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202305/bg2023052801.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202305/bg2023052802.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "自动紧急刹车",
          "content": "<p>美国交通部表示，正考虑让美国所有的轿车，都安装自动紧急刹车装置。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060202.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>一旦前车突然减速，或者前面突然出现行人，该装置会发出警报，并启动刹车。美国交通部的设想是，它以后会像安全带和气囊一样，成为每辆车的标配。</p>\n<p>这意味着，车辆前部必须加一个传感器，可能是雷达，也可能是摄像头，用来检测前方物体。根据研究，这样每年可以防止24000起车祸，少死360个人。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "自动紧急刹车",
              "url": "https://arstechnica.com/cars/2023/05/automatic-emergency-braking-should-become-mandatory-feds-say/"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060202.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "无镜头照相机",
          "content": "<p>一位荷兰设计师发明了一个匪夷所思的装置：无镜头照相机。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060203.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这个照相机的镜头是封死的，它将当前地点的 GPS 坐标和取景器里面的物体轮廓，发给 AI 模型。</p>\n<p>AI 会根据这些信息，生成当前场景的文字描述。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060204.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这些文字会再传给“图像生成引擎”，生成图片。效果非常惊人。下面是实际的街景。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060205.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>下面是这台照相机生成的街景。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060206.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "无镜头照相机",
              "url": "https://bjoernkarmann.dk/project/paragraphica"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060203.webp",
