          "title": "水稻工厂",
          "content": "<p>安徽六安建立了一家智能化水稻工厂，采用培养盘种植水稻。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060703.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>由于是标准化的室内种植，可以保证最适宜的温度和湿度，并进行精确施肥。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060704.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060705.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>虽然非常节约土地和人力，但是它的种植成本高于传统水稻，而且耗电大，如果无法保证获利，还是很难推广。（<a href=\"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/3169\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@shencn</a> 投稿）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060706.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
