      "title": "图片",
      "items": [
        {
          "title": "YBC7289",
          "content": "<p>YBC7289 是一块古代巴比伦的粘土板，制作时间大约是公元前1600年到公元前1800年。</p>\n<p>YBC7289 是它的收藏编号。它是1909年由金融大王J·P·摩根捐献的，不清楚具体的出土时间和地点。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202212/bg2022123001.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它的珍贵之处是，证明了古代巴比伦人知道2的平方根√2，而且能够准确计算，精确度高达99.9999%。</p>\n<p>这块板上刻了一个正方形，还画了对角线，还在对角线上写了数字。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202212/bg2022123002.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这些数字是古代巴比伦的楔形文字，经过辨认是四个数字：1、24、51 和 10。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202212/bg2022123003.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>我们知道古代巴比伦人采用60进制，这四个60进制数字转成十进制，就是1.41421296296。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202212/bg2022123004.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这 √2 匹配到小数点后第六位，准确率为 99.9999%！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202212/bg2022123005.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "YBC7289",
              "url": "https://twitter.com/tivadardanka/status/1608419325706391554"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202212/bg2022123001.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202212/bg2022123002.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202212/bg2022123003.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202212/bg2022123004.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202212/bg2022123005.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "美墨边境墙",
          "content": "<p>美国和墨西哥的边境有一堵巨大的墙，用来阻挡拉美移民偷渡进入美国。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060806.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060807.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这堵墙超过1000公里，目前还在不断延长，可能是美国建造的最大工程。美墨边境一共是3,145公里。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202208/bg2022080505.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202208/bg2022080507.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "美墨边境墙",
              "url": "https://www.theverge.com/c/23203881/border-patrol-wall-surveillance-tech"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060806.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202306/bg2023060807.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202208/bg2022080505.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202208/bg2022080507.webp"
          ]
        }
      ]
